    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>GAME MUSIC SAFE TO LIVESTREAM</u><br><br>Earth is gone. Bricks are to blame.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the last surviving pilot aboard the spaceship <i>Brickoid</i>, you are humanity\u2019s final hope. Equipped with the strangest of weapons\u2014<strong>your balls</strong>\u2014you must face wave after wave of interstellar bricks and uncover the truth behind their origin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude90 <strong>Gameplay Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control <strong>four paddles</strong> at once around your ship for full 360\u00b0 defense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through <strong>30 handcrafted levels</strong> with diverse brick layouts and mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your mode:<br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 <i>Adventure</i> (narrative-driven campaign)<br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 <i>Time Attack</i> (race the clock)<br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 <i>Practice</i> (replay levels freely)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master <strong>gravity-altering black and white holes</strong>, power-ups, and trick bricks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a <strong>retro-futuristic atmosphere</strong> in deep space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock a mysterious, real-world reward</strong> at the end of your journey\u2014if you can survive that long</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Echoes of Humanity</strong><br>What starts as a desperate counterattack becomes something much bigger. Strange patterns emerge in the bricks. Transmissions suggest a conspiracy. And the more you fight, the more the line between enemy and ally begins to blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the nine chapters of this absurd and eerie sci-fi saga, you\u2019ll gather fragments, decrypt codes, question loyalties\u2014and maybe even laugh at how weird this all is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is clear:<br><strong>Keep the balls in play. Smash through the lies. And save what\u2019s left of Earth.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>GAME MUSIC SAFE TO LIVESTREAM</u><br><br>Earth is gone. Bricks are to blame.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the last surviving pilot aboard the spaceship <i>Brickoid</i>, you are humanity\u2019s final hope. Equipped with the strangest of weapons\u2014<strong>your balls</strong>\u2014you must face wave after wave of interstellar bricks and uncover the truth behind their origin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude90 <strong>Gameplay Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control <strong>four paddles</strong> at once around your ship for full 360\u00b0 defense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through <strong>30 handcrafted levels</strong> with diverse brick layouts and mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your mode:<br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 <i>Adventure</i> (narrative-driven campaign)<br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 <i>Time Attack</i> (race the clock)<br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 <i>Practice</i> (replay levels freely)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master <strong>gravity-altering black and white holes</strong>, power-ups, and trick bricks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a <strong>retro-futuristic atmosphere</strong> in deep space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock a mysterious, real-world reward</strong> at the end of your journey\u2014if you can survive that long</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Echoes of Humanity</strong><br>What starts as a desperate counterattack becomes something much bigger. Strange patterns emerge in the bricks. Transmissions suggest a conspiracy. And the more you fight, the more the line between enemy and ally begins to blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the nine chapters of this absurd and eerie sci-fi saga, you\u2019ll gather fragments, decrypt codes, question loyalties\u2014and maybe even laugh at how weird this all is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is clear:<br><strong>Keep the balls in play. Smash through the lies. And save what\u2019s left of Earth.</strong></p>",
